  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the full integration of Gemini-powered Multi-Turn Chat, Image Creation & Editing, and Live Voice Conversations into **GitPet**:\n\n- **Multi-Turn Conversational Companion**:\n  - **Persona & System Roles**: Integrated role selection for **Byte (Mascot)**, **Senior Git Architect**, **Safety Auditor**, and **Git Tutor** with domain-specific system instructions.\n  - **Dynamic Model Routing**: Added model tier switching between **Fast** (`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`), **General** (`gemini-3.5-flash`), and **Deep Analysis** (`gemini-3.1-pro-preview`).\n  - **Voice Readout**: Integrated single-click audio speech readout powered by `gemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview` on every response.\n\n- **Avatar & Image Creation / Editing Studio**:\n  - **Image Generation & Editing**: Added the **Mascot Image Studio** modal powered by `gemini-3.1-flash-image` with custom text-to-image prompts, aspect ratio options (`1:1`, `4:3`, `16:9`), and image-to-image editing with visual reference uploads.\n  - **Live Avatar Skinning**: Custom generated skins and curated presets can be set directly as the active visual avatar in the pet stage.\n\n- **Real-Time Live Voice Conversations**:\n  - **Live Audio Streaming**: Implemented hands-free bidirectional voice conversations with Byte using `gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview` over WebSockets (`/live`).\n  - **Real-Time Visualizer & Audio Queue**: Added 16kHz microphone audio streaming, smooth 24kHz output playback, an animated audio waveform visualizer, and a real-time transcript stream."
    thinking: "**Verifying Feature Completeness**\n\nI\'m now meticulously reviewing all the requested features to ensure complete fulfillment. Currently, I\'m focusing on the multi-turn Gemini Chatbot. I\'ve broken down the requirements for role selection and model tier routing, confirming their inclusion. I\'m making sure to define all parameters, especially the Gemini versions, to avoid any misunderstanding.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the full integration of Gemini-powered Multi-Turn Chat, Image Creation & Editing, and Live Voice Conversations into **GitPet**:\n\n- **Multi-Turn Conversational Companion**:\n  - **Persona & System Roles**: Integrated role selection for **Byte (Mascot)**, **Senior Git Architect**, **Safety Auditor**, and **Git Tutor** with domain-specific system instructions.\n  - **Dynamic Model Routing**: Added model tier switching between **Fast** (`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`), **General** (`gemini-3.5-flash`), and **Deep Analysis** (`gemini-3.1-pro-preview`).\n  - **Voice Readout**: Integrated single-click audio speech readout powered by `gemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview` on every response.\n\n- **Avatar & Image Creation / Editing Studio**:\n  - **Image Generation & Editing**: Added the **Mascot Image Studio** modal powered by `gemini-3.1-flash-image` with custom text-to-image prompts, aspect ratio options (`1:1`, `4:3`, `16:9`), and image-to-image editing with visual reference uploads.\n  - **Live Avatar Skinning**: Custom generated skins and curated presets can be set directly as the active visual avatar in the pet stage.\n\n- **Real-Time Live Voice Conversations**:\n  - **Live Audio Streaming**: Implemented hands-free bidirectional voice conversations with Byte using `gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview` over WebSockets (`/live`).\n  - **Real-Time Visualizer & Audio Queue**: Added 16kHz microphone audio streaming, smooth 24kHz output playback, an animated audio waveform visualizer, and a real-time transcript stream."
