  planner_response {
    response: "I have identified and resolved the runtime errors in the application:\n\n- **Resolved Unicode `btoa` Exception**: Fixed an uncaught `DOMException` in `ImageStudioModal` where `btoa` was being called on strings containing multi-byte UTF-8 emoji characters (`\360\237\220\225`) during initial state evaluation, replacing it with safe URI component encoding (`data:image/svg+xml;utf8,...`).\n- **Defensive Media & Audio Context Handling**:\n  - Added feature-detection guards for `navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia` and `AudioContext` in `LiveVoiceModal` to prevent uncaught promise errors when running inside restricted iframe contexts or unpermitted environments.\n  - Added `.catch()` rejection handlers to `audio.play()` in `ChatStream` to safely handle browser autoplay restrictions and audio interruption errors.\n  - Wrapped `navigator.clipboard.writeText` and `confetti` triggers in safe `try/catch` blocks."
    modified_response: "I have identified and resolved the runtime errors in the application:\n\n- **Resolved Unicode `btoa` Exception**: Fixed an uncaught `DOMException` in `ImageStudioModal` where `btoa` was being called on strings containing multi-byte UTF-8 emoji characters (`\360\237\220\225`) during initial state evaluation, replacing it with safe URI component encoding (`data:image/svg+xml;utf8,...`).\n- **Defensive Media & Audio Context Handling**:\n  - Added feature-detection guards for `navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia` and `AudioContext` in `LiveVoiceModal` to prevent uncaught promise errors when running inside restricted iframe contexts or unpermitted environments.\n  - Added `.catch()` rejection handlers to `audio.play()` in `ChatStream` to safely handle browser autoplay restrictions and audio interruption errors.\n  - Wrapped `navigator.clipboard.writeText` and `confetti` triggers in safe `try/catch` blocks."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
